  "title": "VLA-Rolling: Fewer Denoising Steps, Better Control via Adaptive Action Reuse",
  "summary": "VLA-Rolling introduces a lightweight inference framework that reuses action tails through three stages, reducing action-chunk inference cost and improving success rate. This method leverages adaptive action reuse to achieve efficient and accurate VLA inference.",
